# Kaya, Spirits' Justice's first ability is "one or more" (CR 603.2c): the creature cards exiled together are one batch and one trigger, and
# the choice "from among them" is made among all of them. On turn 3 the +2 surveils Hill Giant and Memnite into the graveyard and exiles Black
# Lotus (not a creature card: no trigger). Tormod's Crypt then exiles the whole graveyard (it sacrificed itself to do it: it is exiled too),
# Hill Giant and Memnite together: one trigger, Bot1 picks Hill Giant out of the two, and the Spirit token becomes a flying Hill Giant.

[Bot1 Deck]
Kaya, Spirits' Justice
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Tormod's Crypt
Island x3
Island
Hill Giant
Memnite
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

